Use lprsetup to set up your printcap file, and you should also include
an output filter, such as /usr/lbin/hplaserof.  So, your printcap
would look something like this:

lp0 | hplj :\
	lp=:\
	of=/usr/lbin/hplaserof:\
	sd=/usr/spool/lp0:

lprsetup will put any other necessary fields into this file.

ken Gordon

