: levine@amarex.com wrote:
: : When we overwrite executables on disk programs running that exe crash...Can I aviod
: : with any link options ???   


	Yeah this is due to demnd paging.  If you need to overwrite an 
existing (and running) executable, simply 'rm' it first.  If the file 
is in use, the inode will be kept until it's no longer in use and the 
program will continue running.  So if you rm the file first, then copy the 
new version  in, you should be ok.




