Subject: Roll-yer-own Alpha OSF box
Date: 1996/02/14
Message-ID: <31227482.31DF@garply.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 139400750
content-type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
organization: Net Results, Inc.
mime-version: 1.0
