similarly endowed high end Pentium solution.  And it'll run NT, Linux or OSF.

Anyway, that's enough of the nasty commercial discussion.  I didn't start 
this thread to sell 'em, just to let y'all know they exist and find out 
if anyone else is using 'em for OSF.

I'll be running some benchmarks on the new box sometime this week, I'll 
post the results.  If anyone has any bench test code they would like to see 
