We ran AdvFS and reverted to ufs as well. AdvFS gave us a major performance
boost on the news spool, as in 5-6 times faster article spooling. We'd tried
it initially under 3.0, with the default metadata extent size; when we
installed 3.2A, right after the metadata filled up, I used -x 2048 (yes, I
